      "Bash(gh issue create --repo datafund/swarm_provenance_SDK --title \"Epic: Swarm Provenance TypeScript SDK v0.1\" --body \"$\\(cat <<''EOF''\n## Overview\n\nCreate a professional TypeScript SDK \\(@datafund/swarm-provenance\\) that lets browser/Node.js apps store and retrieve provenance data via the Swarm provenance gateway. First consumer: Fairdrop v3.\n\n## Scope \\(v0.1\\)\n\n- Upload provenance data \\(metadata wrapping + stamp pool + gateway upload\\)\n- Download + verify by Swarm reference\n- Stamp pool acquisition \\(fast stamps\\)\n- Notary signing + EIP-191 signature verification\n- Gateway health check\n\nOut of scope for v0.1: x402 payments, manual stamp management\n\n## Architecture\n\nApp \\(Fairdrop v3\\) -> ProvenanceClient \\(this SDK\\) -> Provenance Gateway -> Swarm\n\n## Tech Stack\n\nTypeScript 5.x, ESM + CJS dual output \\(tsup\\), vitest, pnpm, native fetch, @noble/hashes\n\n## Distribution\n\n- Phase 1: GitHub dependency\n- Phase 2: npm publish as @datafund/swarm-provenance\nEOF\n\\)\")",
